cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the released artefacts, please cite the article below."
title: "INT8-Quantization Robustness for Edge-FPGA License-Plate Recognition — artefacts"
abstract: >-
  Scripts, calibration configurations, compiled INT8 models and per-run result files behind the
  paper "INT8-Quantization Robustness for Edge-FPGA License-Plate Recognition: A Two-Stage Thai
  ANPR System on the AMD Kria KV260". Includes the multi-seed csp4 ablation, the quantization-aware
  training comparison, per-layer activation statistics with simulated INT8 SQNR, on-board latency
  and power measurements on a Kria KV260, and a cross-domain replication on CCPD2020 and Open
  Images V7.
type: software
